Homefront Music Card
====================

This card is a fork/derivative of:

  custom-sonos-card / maxi-media-player
  Copyright (c) punxaphil and contributors
  https://github.com/punxaphil/custom-sonos-card
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The upstream source is vendored under `maxi-media-player/` and retains its
original Apache 2.0 LICENSE. Modifications by the Homefront Music Card
authors (notably an added Music Assistant source/account-separated media
browser) are also released under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

A copy of the Apache License is at `maxi-media-player/LICENSE`.

Changes from upstream:
- Added a "Sources" media-browser view that browses Music Assistant's native
  per-provider/per-account tree (via the `music/browse` command), so multiple
  accounts of the same provider (e.g. two Spotify accounts) are separated
  rather than merged into one flat library list.
- Renamed the registered card element to `homefront-music-card` to avoid
  collision with the upstream `sonos-card` / `maxi-media-player` elements.
